---

Note on the corpora used by this project. The code downloads, but does not
redistribute, three third-party datasets, each of which remains under the terms
set by its own authors:

  * Large Movie Review Dataset (aclImdb), Maas et al. (2011),
    https://ai.stanford.edu/~amaas/data/sentiment/
  * Polarity dataset v2.0, Pang & Lee (2004),
    https://www.cs.cornell.edu/people/pabo/movie-review-data/
  * Sentence polarity dataset v1.0, Pang & Lee (2005),
    https://www.cs.cornell.edu/people/pabo/movie-review-data/
